  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under IRC Section 385 and the multi-factor debt-equity test, proportional holdings of debt and equity is one of the strongest indicators of disguised equity. When shareholders hold notes in the same 50/50 ratio as their stock, courts treat this as evidence the advances function as capital contributions rather than genuine loans.
